        "text": {
            "description_html": "<b>Deltana FP222, Rectangular Solid Brass Flush Pull</b>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nThis Deltana made solid brass rectangular flush door pull is for use on pocket doors, sliding doors, cabinet doors, any door where a flush with the door face pull is desired. It measures 3-1/8\" high by 15/16\" wide. Packaged with matching finish mounting screws for easy installation.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p align=\"center\">\r\n<img src=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/DEL-FP222-Specifications.gif?v=1704354505\" width=\"384\" height=\"279\" border=\"0\" atl=\"Deltana FP222 Rectangular Flush Door Pull Specifications\">\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Specifications</b> for the Deltana FP222 Flush Door Pull:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Overall Height: 3-1/8\"</li>\r\n<li>Overall Width: 1-5/16\"</li>\r\n<li>Overall Depth: 7/16\"</li>\r\n<li>Projection: 1/8\"</li>\r\n<li>Cutout Depth: 5/16\"</li>\r\n<li>Cutout Height: 2-3/4\"</li>\r\n<li>Cutout Width: 3/4\"</li>\r\n<li>Material: 1/8\" Thick Solid Brass</li>\r\n<li>Packaged with matching finish mounting screws.</li>\r\n<li><a href=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/FP222.pdf?v=1704262160\" target=\"new\"><b>Deltana FP222  Dimensions  Diagram (PDF)</a></b></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nNo matter which finish you choose for the outside, it will still be solid brass material inside.\r\n</p>",
