                "title": "Rectangle Flush Door Pull | Deltana FP222",
                "description": "Rectangular Solid Brass Flush Pull Deltana FP222 - This Deltana made solid brass rectangular flush door pull is for use on pocket doors, sliding doors, cabinet doors, any door where a lush with the door face pull is desired. It measures 3-1/8 inches high by 15/16 inches wide. Packaged with matching finish mounting screws for easy installation.\r\n",
